{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elixir of Moonglow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, under the moonlight glow, a girl named Ella opened her eyes to the world. By her side was Umbra, a loyal wolf and her dearest friend. Together, they wandered through glowing caves, towering mountains, and lush oasis pools, as Ella gathered ingredient, brew potions as an Alchemist Apprentice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, Ella took a peek by the window, as the first chapter of her story began</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth with your companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon Umbra to clear thorns, scare off critters, or to carry you across rivers. Umbra isn\u2019t just helpful, he\u2019s your loyal companion, a friend, learning together what life means in this world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/extras/cf5407e0e89975107ea2150cfe0d2f46.poster.avif?t=1766372489\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/extras/cf5407e0e89975107ea2150cfe0d2f46.webm?t=1766372489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Best Alchemist you can be</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to become the best alchemist in town. Combine tangy, juicy, and whimsical ingredients to unlock tools and uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/extras/f161d57ccf3a8538f98bb8e20ab3a407.poster.avif?t=1766372489\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/extras/f161d57ccf3a8538f98bb8e20ab3a407.webm?t=1766372489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Multiple Diverse Biome</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a world of beautiful hand-drawn scenery, unique biomes, and unforgettable landmarks. Discover glowing caves, lush valleys, and quiet corners where magic lingers and every detail invites exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/extras/9b3531ae8ef1dd932cc9c07a99d4e169.poster.avif?t=1766372489\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/extras/9b3531ae8ef1dd932cc9c07a99d4e169.webm?t=1766372489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play it on your own time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on your own phase, there are no lives to lose. Explore freely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a cozy couch game where the whole family can enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to uncover the story of Ella and Umbra</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920900?t=1766372489","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920900?t=1766372489","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/fbaed9b49f0fb3da148467b4077b5f0e182a6ad6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766372489","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920900/fbaed9b49f0fb3da148467b4077b5f0e182a6ad6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766372489","categories":[{"description":"Single-p